Chapter: LinLaunderClosure
  cites Foreword chapter Linear

 Probe (closed by LinearOwnership stage 4): a let-bound closure that
 captures a linear value owns it and is call-once. Calling it twice
 is a double-spend - CDX2061.

Section: Definitions

  spend : linear Integer -> Integer
  spend (n) = let g = (\x -> n + x)
   in g 1 + g 2

  opening : Text = show (spend 10)

